# Remote navigation

Arrow keys move through `moveFocus`. Enter activates the focused control. Escape closes the open panel and restores the previous target.

- Keep a visible accent focus ring. Do not hide focus.
- Do not steal Left and Right from a volume or brightness slider.
- Do not trap focus: every panel has a close control.

```ts
setFocus(moveFocus(items, focus, event.key));
```

Do not rely on hover for a control that a remote must reach.
